#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
#| "Guides</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Guides</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar este comando a partir da barra de menus da janela de "
"imagem em <menuchoice><guimenu>Visualizar</guimenu><guimenuitem>Exibir as "
"guias</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"

#: src/menus/view/show-guides.xml:43(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "or by using the keyboard shortcut "
#| "<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>T</keycap></keycombo>."
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>T</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ou através do atalho de teclado "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>T</keycap></keycombo>."

#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:10(title)
#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:17(primary)
msgid "Show Grid"
msgstr "Exibir grade"

#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:14(secondary)
msgid "Show/Mask Grid"
msgstr "Exibir/esconder grade"

#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:20(para)
msgid ""
"By using the <guimenuitem>Show Grid</guimenuitem> command, you can enable "
"and disable displaying the grid. When you enable it, the grid overlays the "
"image and makes it easier for you to line up selected image elements."
msgstr ""
"Ao usar o comando <guimenuitem>Esconder grade</guimenuitem>, você pode "
"ativar e desativar a exibição da grade. Quando ativada, a grade sobrepõe a "
"imagem e torna fácil para você posicionar elementos de imagem."

#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:26(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can set the default for the grid in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
#| "image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the grid in the <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"image-window-appearance\">Image Window Appearance Preferences</link>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode definir o padrão da grade nas <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-"
"window-appearance\">Preferências de aparência da janela de imagem</link>."

#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:31(para)
msgid ""
"See also the <link linkend=\"gimp-image-configure-grid\">Configure "
"Grid</link> command and the <link linkend=\"gimp-view-snap-to-grid\">Snap to"
" Grid</link> command."
msgstr ""
"Veja também o comando <link linkend=\"gimp-image-configure-grid\">Configurar"
" grade</link> e o comando <link linkend=\"gimp-view-snap-to-grid\">Atrair "
"para a grade</link>."

#: src/menus/view/show-grid.xml:41(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
#| "Grid</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Grid</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar este comando a partir da barra de menus da janela de "
"imagem em <menuchoice><guimenu>Visualizar</guimenu><guimenuitem>Exibir "
"grade</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:5(title)
#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:12(primary)
#| msgid "Show Layer Boundary"
msgid "Show Canvas Boundary"
msgstr "Mostrar limite da tela"

#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:8(primary)
#| msgid "Layer boundary"
msgid "Canvas boundary"
msgstr "Limite da tela"

#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:9(secondary)
#| msgid "Show/mask layer boundary"
msgid "Show/mask canvas boundary"
msgstr "Mostrar/mascarar o limite da tela"

#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:15(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guimenuitem>Show Guides</guimenuitem> command enables and disables "
#| "displaying of <link linkend=\"glossary-guides\">Guides</link> in the image "
#| "window."
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Show Canvas Boundary</guimenuitem> command enables or "
"disables displaying the canvas boundary in the image window."
msgstr ""
"O comando <guimenuitem>Mostrar limite da tela</guimenuitem> habilita ou "
"desabilita a exibição do limite da tela na janela de imagem."

#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:19(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can set the default for the layer boundary in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
#| "prefs-image-window\">Image Window Appearance</link> dialog."
msgid ""
"You can set the default for the canvas boundary in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"prefs-image-window-appearance\">Image Window Appearance Preferences</link>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode definir o padrão do limite da tela nas <link linkend=\"gimp-prefs-"
"image-window-appearance\">Preferências de aparência da janela de "
"imagem</link>."

#: src/menus/view/show-canvas-boundary.xml:26(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Layer "
#| "Boundary</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Canvas "
"Boundary</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar este comando a partir da barra de menus da janela de "
"imagem em <menuchoice><guimenu>Visualizar</guimenu><guimenuitem>Exibir "
"limites de camada</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

